  "instance_name": "antisemitic_stereotype_jews_pretending_to_be_white",
  "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype: Jews Pretending to Be White",
  "description": "This is a derogatory antisemitic trope that falsely claims Jewish people are not ethnically 'white' and are therefore 'pretending' to fit into white society. It is used to dehumanize and marginalize Jewish people by denying their legitimacy within the racial or ethnic framework of the dominant society. This stereotype is rooted in historical antisemitism and is often used to justify discrimination and violence against Jewish communities.",
